WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.350
Phnom Penh. A capital of garment factories and metal roofs, hottest before the rains.

2
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:12.320
In hot months, garment workers reporting heat symptoms rose to eighty-eight per cent.

3
00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.920
A proposal would give the city heat thresholds.

4
00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:20.420
Cooler factories protect workers, and the work.
